# The Stalker's Hollow's bone pit (CIPlay stalkers_hollow_spikes, 11-08; in a test world, under CIGapsWatchHealth): the
# pit behind the den rock (dig 60..66 x 34.5, floor about -1.6), three stakes with spike zones shspike1-3 at x 61, 63,
# 65 (radius 1.5, damage 4, safe=none), plank ledges along both rims (z 36.6 and 32.4), the sign at 55 42.
# The pit floor is real floor (expect stand), standing on it costs health, the planks do not.
island The Stalker's Hollow keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect stand 61 34.5 h=-1.6 below=3
expect stand 65 34.5 h=-1.6 below=3
expect stand 62.25 36.6 h=2.1 below=4
picture sh_pit_out 56 5 42 63 0 34.5
at 63 34.5 h=-1
wait 3
picture sh_spikes 63 3 39 63 -1.5 34.5
wait 3
at 62.25 36.6 h=2.6
wait 2
picture sh_pit_ledge 58 4 36.6 66 2 33
